---
/*
 * DRAFT privacy policy describing what this website actually does.
 * Have it reviewed by someone qualified for the countries you operate in before launch.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site, businessName } from '../lib/content';
const updated = '24 November 2026';
const contactLine = site.contact.email ? site.contact.email : 'our contact form';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description={`How ${businessName} collects and uses personal information on ${site.domain}.`}>
  <PageHero title="Privacy policy" lead={`Last updated ${updated}`} crumbs={[{ href: '/privacy/', label: 'Privacy policy' }]} />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>This policy explains what personal information {businessName} ("we", "us") collects through {site.domain}, why we collect it and how we look after it.</p>

      <h2>Information you give us</h2>
      <p>When you send an enquiry through our contact form, we collect the details you enter: your name, company, email address, phone number, the service you are interested in, the team size you have in mind and your message. We also record that you agreed to be contacted.</p>

      <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The page you sent the enquiry from and any campaign tags in the web address (such as utm_source), so we know how you found us.</li>
        <li>A one-way encrypted (hashed) version of your IP address and your browser's user agent, used only to prevent spam and abuse of the form.</li>
        <li>Standard server logs kept by our hosting provider for security and troubleshooting.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This website does not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your enquiry and discuss the services you asked about.</li>
        <li>To prepare a proposal if you request one.</li>
        <li>To keep a record of enquiries and protect the form from spam.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

      <h2>Where your information is stored</h2>
      <p>Enquiries are stored in a database on our web hosting account and sent to our business email. If we later use a customer relationship management (CRM) system, your enquiry may be stored there too, only for the purposes above.</p>

      <h2>Spam protection</h2>
      <p>Our form may use Cloudflare Turnstile to check that enquiries are sent by people, not automated programs. Cloudflare processes limited technical information to do this, under its own privacy policy.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiries for as long as needed to respond and to maintain a business relationship, and then delete them or make them anonymous.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or to stop contacting you. Contact us through {contactLine} and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
